{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03290",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 10.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.53,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.57,
      "end_seconds": 32.37,
      "duration_seconds": 16.8,
      "text": "Yeah, doctor, it's bloating when I slip up. It's getting on my nerves now. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 33.92,
      "end_seconds": 43.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature 36.7, pulse is 65 beats a minute, BP is 112 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.53,
      "end_seconds": 48.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Thanks. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.37,
      "end_seconds": 52.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.23,
      "end_seconds": 63.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.44,
      "end_seconds": 78.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "Only avoiding gluten, and it's not much. Mostly mild. It's worse with gluten. Oh, and a rash on my elbows. That's been about the same, three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.43,
      "end_seconds": 85.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight loss, diarrhoea, bone pain or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.56,
      "end_seconds": 91.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, diarrhoea, bone pain or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.28,
      "end_seconds": 93.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.48,
      "end_seconds": 97.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.0,
      "end_seconds": 101.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.33,
      "end_seconds": 109.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Oh, my heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.99,
      "end_seconds": 113.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.74,
      "end_seconds": 127.75,
      "duration_seconds": 13.01,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for about ten years now. I've been putting this off for weeks. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.32,
      "end_seconds": 129.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.3,
      "end_seconds": 138.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.11,
      "end_seconds": 140.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.07,
      "end_seconds": 157.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.09,
      "end_seconds": 172.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "Alendronate. I take it 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones. Right, I'm on atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.63,
      "end_seconds": 182.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.86,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.25,
      "end_seconds": 200.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.5,
      "end_seconds": 218.09,
      "duration_seconds": 15.59,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I walk the dog every morning. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.74,
      "end_seconds": 219.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.19,
      "end_seconds": 224.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.52,
      "end_seconds": 229.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.43,
      "end_seconds": 232.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.21,
      "end_seconds": 238.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.59,
      "end_seconds": 241.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.83,
      "end_seconds": 264.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and your weight is stable on the scales."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.85,
      "end_seconds": 272.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.83,
      "end_seconds": 289.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.05,
      "end_seconds": 294.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I mean, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.07,
      "end_seconds": 331.36,
      "duration_seconds": 36.29,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure, and we'll know more once the a blood count is back. I'm sending you for a blood count because of coeliac follow-up. Let's book coeliac antibodies to look into coeliac follow-up. Check labels carefully and use separate toasters and chopping boards. I'd like you to see the dietitian as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.27,
      "end_seconds": 338.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.04,
      "end_seconds": 340.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.65,
      "end_seconds": 345.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in twelve months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.54,
      "end_seconds": 348.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.57,
      "end_seconds": 353.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.93,
      "end_seconds": 358.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "So, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.38,
      "end_seconds": 361.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}